# Token Efficiency

- Do not repeatedly read the entire repository.
- Search for relevant files/symbols first.
- Read only the context required for the current task.
- Reuse existing components and utilities.
- Avoid rewriting unchanged files.
- Avoid long explanations in code comments.
- Do not generate unnecessary documentation.
- Group closely related small changes when safe.
- Do not perform unrelated cleanup.
- Keep completion reports concise.
